---
description: Pair text/icons with the correct surface so contrast stays readable in light and dark
alwaysApply: true
---

# Color surface pairing

Follow [.llm/color-palette.md](mdc:.llm/color-palette.md) — especially **§0 Surface → Foreground pairing**.

## Pairing matrix (short)

| Surface | Text | Iconify / spinner hex |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Neutral (`bg-primary`, `bg-canvas`, sheets) | `text-text-primary` / `text-text-primary-lighter` | `COLORS.*.icon.primary` |
| Primary CTA (`bg-secondary` slate invert) | `text-text-secondary` (theme-aware) | `COLORS.*.text.contrast` |
| Selection (`bg-accent-sky-bg`) | `text-accent-sky` or `text-text-primary` | `#0284C7` / `#38BDF8` |
| Success tint (`bg-secondary-lighter`) | `text-green-increase` | `status.success` / `icon.brand` |

Canonical CTA icons: `AppButton` / `AppButtonV2` `getIconColor()`.

## Do

```tsx
// Header on bg-primary / sheet
<Iconify icon="heroicons:chevron-left" size={24} color={isDark ? COLORS.dark.icon.primary : COLORS.light.icon.primary} />
<AppText className="text-text-primary">Title</AppText>
<AppText className="text-text-primary-lighter">Meta</AppText>

// Primary CTA — contrast label + icon (via AppButton renderIcon color)
<AppButton variant="primary" renderIcon={(c) => <Iconify icon="heroicons:plus-circle" size={18} color={c} />}>
  Create
</AppButton>

// Selected row
<View className="bg-accent-sky-bg border border-accent-sky" />
```

## Do not

```tsx
// CTA contrast text as muted body → invisible / wrong on sheets
<AppText className="text-text-secondary">Loading more...</AppText>

// Emerald icon on slate CTA → wrong contrast family
color={COLORS.light.icon.brand} // on bg-bg-secondary button

// CTA contrast icons on neutral header
color={COLORS.light.text.contrast} // on bg-bg-primary header

// Emerald for selection or full-screen chrome
className="bg-bg-secondary/10" // selected row — use accent-sky*
className="flex-1 bg-bg-secondary" // screen shell — use bg-bg-primary
```

## Also

- Same control: label and icon share contrast family.
- Dividers: `border-border-input`, not `border-bg-secondary-lighter`.
- Sheet body ≈ canvas; sheet header icons = `icon.primary`.
- Emerald = money+/success only (`green-increase`, `bg-secondary-lighter`).
- Iconify `icon` prop stays a string literal (see iconify-string-literals rule); only `color` is dynamic.
